    'Assisted living installations demand aesthetic integration, quiet cable routing, and respectful technician demeanor. Our Fort Worth team delivers turnkey systems that give senior residents and families total peace of mind.',
    'We install commercial camera systems for assisted living communities, retirement villages, and memory care centers across the Hulen and Camp Bowie corridors, Ridgmar, the Chisholm Trail Parkway growth band, the I-35W and AllianceTexas corridor, and the surrounding communities of Keller, Southlake, Colleyville, Grapevine, Mansfield, Burleson, Saginaw, Haltom City, White Settlement, Hurst, Bedford, Euless, Arlington, and Weatherford. Older campuses with multiple courtyards and service doors need broader perimeter and gate coverage, while newer purpose-built buildings can have camera pathways designed into the structured cabling before ceilings close. Every layout is walked with your executive director and aimed to keep resident apartments, bathing rooms, and treatment spaces out of frame. Our technicians are background-checked, work quietly around meal service and activity programming, and specify IP67 and IK10 exterior hardware for North Texas hail and heat with the recorder kept in a locked conditioned room.',
